      },
      "message": "fix(post): regenerate the multiaxis catalog golden for the upright return\n\n`examples/catalog/multiaxis/indexed/indexed.nc` gains the return block of\n`uprightAfterTilt()` in two sections. Each block is three lines:\n`G91 G28 Z0`, `G90`, `G00 A0.`.\n\n- \"Back pocket\" follows \"Front pocket\" at A90.\n- \"Tilted pocket\" follows \"Back pocket\" at A-90.\n\nSix lines in total. No other line of the file changes. The case was made\nagain with `cargo xtask catalog --case multiaxis/indexed`.\n\nThe case has two tilted sections in a row. The return between two tilted\nsections is kept on purpose. Two new tests pin it:\n`fanuc_returns_to_zero_between_two_tilted_sections` and\n`doosan_returns_to_zero_between_two_tilted_sections` in\n`crates/post/tests/upright_after_tilt.rs`. The decision record says so.\n\nRefs #3466\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
