      "message": "fix(post): a canned cycle that opens a section after a tilt is refused\n\nThe uprightReturn law read only Move records. A section that opens with\na CYCLE record (cycle only, or a cycle before a move that states zero\nangles) posted at the old lean with no warning. The first record that\ncommands motion now includes a cycle; a cycle states no rotary angle.\n\nPinned by a_cycle_that_opens_an_upright_section_after_a_tilt_is_refused_by_name\nand the unit tests a_cycle_only_section_after_a_lean_is_refused_by_name\nand a_cycle_before_a_later_stated_zero_is_refused.\n\nRefs #3477\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
